  designNotes: 'Mechanics test: a Briefing Watchdog (GDD 3.11). From the Day after
    it''s created, before anything resolves, it redirects the strongest enemy attack
    to a random creature (the one with the most Heat first). 2 charges, one per attack
    it redirects.'
  artDescription: 'A remake of the first Counter-Strike box cover: a counter-terrorist
    and a terrorist in a tense standoff in a dusty corridor, but both are accountants
    in thick glasses, aiming pocket calculators at each other like rifles, ledgers
    fluttering around them.'
